  "description": "Test build of Illaoi as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Illaoi so her tentacles grow on the edge of the walls near her, strike the enemies Harsh Lesson marked and the Vessels first, Test of Spirit's spirit echoes her hits and breaks into a Vessel when its champion walks off. 0.3.0: every tentacle has a body of its own through the mod API's spawn_unit - targetable, it can be killed (20% of her health), it does not walk or strike on its own, hidden while it rises; the add-on lashes from the body's spot, a destroyed body takes its tentacle; a host that gives no unit keeps the pictures. Needs the main pack's sheet league/champions/league_illaoi_tentacle_body. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
